{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15286","headline":"赠薛戴 · 李端","name":"赠薛戴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓雾忽爲霜，寒蝉还罢响。\n行人在长道，日暮多归想。\n射策本何功，名登绦帐中。\n遂矜丘室重，不料阮途穷。\n交结慙时辈，龙锺似老翁。\n机非鄙夫正，懒是平生性。\n欹枕鸿雁高，闭关花药盛。\n厨烟当雨绝，阶竹连窗暝。\n欲赋苦饥行，无如消渴病。\n旧业历胡尘，荒原少四邻。\n田园空有处，兄弟未成人。\n毛义心长苦，袁安家转贫。\n今呈胸臆事，当爲泪沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}